{"sources":{"odeon":{"ok":true,"films":[{"title":"Ebenezer - Eine Weihnachtsgeschichte","lang":"DE","genre":["Abenteuer","Fantasy"],"dauer":116,"fsk":"10+","text":"Der knauserige Geizhals Ebenezer Scrooge (Johnny Depp) macht eine übernatürliche Begegnung, die sein Leben verändert und mit den prägenden Stationen seines Lebens konfrontiert wird. Geister der Vergangenheit (Andrea Riseborough), Gegenwart (Tramell Tillman) und Zukunft (Robert Strange) treten dabei gleichermaßen in den Fokus und zwingen ihn, sich seinen Entscheidungen und deren Folgen zu stellen.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/62002/ebenezer.webp?v=1794755190","trailer":"https://youtu.be/sFvLZy7dW0w","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/ebenezer-eine-weihnachtsgeschichte","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-19","time":"19:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-20","time":"19:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-21","time":"20:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-22","time":"19:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-25","time":"19:30"}]},{"title":"Der Regenbogenfisch","lang":"DE","genre":["Animation"],"dauer":68,"fsk":"0+","text":"Mit seinen schimmernden Glitzerschuppen zieht der Regenbogenfisch (gesprochen von Jannik Schümann) die Blicke aller Meeresbewohner auf sich. Sein Stolz und seine Eitelkeit sorgen jedoch dafür, dass er sich immer weiter von den anderen Fischen entfernt und schließlich einsam wird.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/62028/regenbogenfisch.webp?v=1794936231","trailer":"https://youtu.be/LYRHp0SFd4s","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/der-regenbogenfisch","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-19","time":"17:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-20","time":"17:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-21","time":"16:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-22","time":"15:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-24","time":"17:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-25","time":"17:30"}]},{"title":"Shaun das Schaf - Spuk im Kürbisfeld","lang":"DE","genre":["Abenteuer","Animation"],"dauer":80,"fsk":"0+","text":"Auf der Mossy Bottom Farm laufen die Vorbereitungen für Halloween auf Hochtouren. Die Vorfreude der Schafherde wird jedoch jäh getrübt, als der tollpatschige Farmer versehentlich das Kürbisbeet zerstört. Entschlossen, das Fest doch noch zu retten, sucht Shaun nach einer Lösung und greift dabei zu ungewöhnlichen Mitteln.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/shaun.webp?v=1790695157%2C0.4954%2C0.7366","trailer":"https://youtu.be/_dk7a5t7t-o","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/shaun-das-schaf-spuk-im-kürbisfeld","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-18","time":"17:30"}]},{"title":"Emil und die Detektive","lang":"DE","genre":["Abenteuer"],"dauer":100,"fsk":"0+","text":"Für Emil (Nicholas Jonah Peter) beginnen die Sommerferien mit einer Zugfahrt nach Berlin, wo er seine Großmutter Renate Tischbein (Ursula Werner) besuchen will. Noch unterwegs wird ihm jedoch das Geld von dem Betrüger Max Grundeis (Merlin Sandmeyer) gestohlen.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/61865/GER-EMIL-Poster2764x4096.webp?v=1792594814%2C0.4706%2C0.2115","trailer":"https://youtu.be/wXsh-55i4GI","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/emil-und-die-detektive","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-18","time":"17:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-19","time":"17:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-20","time":"17:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-21","time":"16:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-22","time":"15:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-25","time":"17:30"}]},{"title":"Der perfekte Urlaub","lang":"DE","genre":["Komödie"],"dauer":117,"fsk":"6+","text":"Leo (Elyas M'Barek), Pepe (Florian David Fitz), Rocco (Wotan Wilke Möhring) und Simon (Frederick Lau) wollen auf Mallorca Abstand von den Ereignissen der vergangenen Zeit gewinnen. Seit dem eskalierten Handy-Spiel ist ihre Freundschaft schwer belastet.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/61894/31065.webp?v=1792474501%2C0.4853%2C0.3324","trailer":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4Ay4YQX0iiY","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/der-perfekte-urlaub","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-18","time":"19:30"}]},{"title":"Die Tribute von Panem - Sunrise On The Reaping","lang":"DE","genre":["Abenteuer","Action","Fantasy"],"dauer":158,"fsk":"10+","text":"24 Jahre vor Katniss Everdeens Teilnahme an den Hungerspielen gerät Haymitch Abernathy (Joseph Zada) ins Zentrum eines Ereignisses, das sein Leben nachhaltig prägen wird. In den Distrikten stehen die 50. Hungerspiele an, die als zweites Jubel-Jubiläum mit verschärften Regeln ausgetragen werden.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/62005/Panem.webp?v=1794755521","trailer":"https://youtu.be/3xfVyH0iwlc","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/die-tribute-von-panem-sunrise-on-the-reaping","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-19","time":"19:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-20","time":"19:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-21","time":"17:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-22","time":"16:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-24","time":"19:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-25","time":"19:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-21","time":"20:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-22","time":"19:30"}]},{"title":"Se domani non torno","lang":"IT","genre":["Drama"],"dauer":106,"fsk":"0+","text":"Gino Cecchettin è un padre vedovo con tre figli che accudisce con amore, in sostituzione della moglie: Elena, Giulia e Davide. La prima vive già fuori casa, la seconda sta per laurearsi in ingegneria biomedica, il terzo è ancora minorenne. La notte in cui Giulia non torna a casa senza avvisare, cosa non da lei, Gino comincia a preoccuparsi, soprattutto dopo che scopre che lei era in compagnia del ragazzo che aveva da poco lasciato.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/se-domani.webp?v=1794332881","trailer":"https://youtu.be/_3ggsnabhfw","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/se-domani-non-torno","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-18","time":"19:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-21","time":"18:15"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-22","time":"17:15"}]},{"title":"Calle Málaga","lang":"IT","genre":["Drama"],"dauer":116,"fsk":"10+","text":"Maria Angeles è un'anziana signora spagnola che vive a Tangeri, la città del nord del Marocco che è stata a lungo protettorato spagnolo, terra di immigrazione e crocevia di lingue e di culture. In fuga da Franco una grande comunità spagnola si era trasferita lì negli anni Trenta e Maria Angeles è la discendente di quelle famiglie che hanno scelto di restare, invece di tornare in Spagna.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/62039/calle.webp?v=1794937027","trailer":"https://youtu.be/vtZOgip3yt8","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/calle-málaga","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-24","time":"18:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-24","time":"20:30"}]}],"soon":[{"title":"Avengers 5: Doomsday","lang":"DE","release":"","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/avengers.webp?v=1786294375","trailer":"https://youtu.be/GKVUZvWk6Aw?si=LB8vkd1C2g-Gl-Qz"},{"title":"Dune 3","lang":"DE","release":"","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/dune.webp?v=1786294638","trailer":"https://youtu.be/txhL-x8uE-Q?si=bx9MAhRDaU3OUAI7"},{"title":"Wie verhext","lang":"DE","release":"","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/62008/019255-33_Hexed_HP_JPG_DINA3_RZ_300dpi_C